        "name": "WHO",
        "url": "http://who.int"
      }
    },
    "ig": {
      "_comment": "What this repository is, per the content types its layers register (beans folio-assistant-nr5p, folio-assistant-cz17). `dak`: smart-base's DAK content type (`smart-base/schemas/dak-content-type.ts`, indexSection `dak`), replacing `dak.json`. `ig`: fhir-harness's `ig` content type; `include` is everything the harness reads in this repository.",
